ZVSE2

; Register on each new/loaded map.
!?FU(OnStartOrLoad);
!!SN:F^Combat_SwitchingCreatureAction:SetOnBattleStackActionDetermination^/(OnBattleStackActionDetermination);

; x1: stack ID 0..41; x2: current owner hero ID, or -1.
; x3..x9: flags, 0 = disallow, 1 = allow when physically available.
; Inputs already contain native availability. Leave unchanged to keep it.
!?FU(OnBattleStackActionDetermination);
!#VA(stackId:x) (heroId:x) (melee:x) (shoot:x) (areaShot:x) (castEnemy:x) (castAlly:x) (castHex:x) (attackReturn:x);

; Optional examples. Enable a receiver by changing its first character to !.
; Disable ordinary shots while keeping area targeting independent:
*!VR(shoot):S0;
; Allow area shots when the stack currently has this ability:
*!VR(areaShot):S1;
; Keep ally spells, but disable enemy spells and corpse/hex spells:
*!VR(castEnemy):S0;
*!VR(castAlly):S1;
*!VR(castHex):S0;
; Disable melee and the dependent return/stay choices:
*!VR(melee):S0;
; Disable the choice between returning and staying after a melee attack:
*!VR(attackReturn):S0;

; Optional log:
*!VR(actionReport:z):S^Stack %(stackId), hero %(heroId): melee=%(melee), shoot=%(shoot), area=%(areaShot), enemy=%(castEnemy), ally=%(castAlly), hex=%(castHex), return=%(attackReturn)^;
*!IF:L^%(actionReport)^;

